---
layout: base.njk
title: "Новости"
description: "Все публикации движения: новости, программа, аналитика и события."
bodyClass: page-news
---

<section class="page-head">
  <div class="container" data-reveal>
    <div class="eyebrow">Лента публикаций</div>
    <h1>Новости</h1>
    <p>Публикации движения — от свежих к более ранним.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-news section-news--full">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="news-tools" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 100ms">
      <label class="news-search">
        <span class="sr-only">Поиск по новостям</span>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 21l-4.3-4.3M17 10a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        <input type="search" id="newsSearch" placeholder="Поиск по новостям…" autocomplete="off">
      </label>

      <div class="news-cats" id="newsCats" role="tablist" aria-label="Категории">
        <button type="button" class="cat-chip is-active" data-cat="" role="tab" aria-selected="true">Все</button>
        {% for cat in categories.items %}
        <button type="button" class="cat-chip" data-cat="{{ cat.name }}" style="--cat: {{ cat.color }}" role="tab" aria-selected="false">{{ cat.name }}</button>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="news-grid" id="newsGrid">
      {% for item in collections.news | sortNews %}
        <div class="news-card-wrap" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: {{ loop.index0 * 90 + 160 }}ms" data-title="{{ item.data.title | lower }}" data-text="{{ (item.data.description or '') | lower }}" data-cat="{{ item.data.category or '' }}">
          {% include "news-card.njk" %}
        </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <p class="news-empty is-hidden" id="newsEmpty">По вашему запросу ничего не найдено.</p>
  </div>
</section>
